# When Aisling Leprechaun becomes blocked, its triggered ability changes the blocker from colorless to green
# before combat damage, and the effect remains on a later turn (CR 603.2, 611.2a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Aisling Leprechaun
Forest x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Aisling Leprechaun.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Aisling Leprechaun > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Aisling Leprechaun)
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Colors = (absent)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Colors = Green
[T4 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Colors = Green
